cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "local-gain-sensitivity: code for 'When local amplification predicts downstream sensitivity in neural networks'"
abstract: >-
  Token-local gain (sigma_1 of a block's token-local Jacobian) estimated by power iteration on J^T J with
  forward- and reverse-mode products, the matched perturbation assay, the controlled training experiments,
  the pretrained-model census, and the scripts that regenerate every figure and table of the paper.
authors:
  - family-names: Porter
    given-names: Anthony
    affiliation: "Australian Institute for Machine Learning, Adelaide University"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Diogenes67/local-gain-sensitivity"
keywords:
  - Jacobian
  - local gain
  - perturbation sensitivity
  - transformers
  - interpretability
